WEBVTT

00:10:58.278 --> 00:11:01.490
If a protein is needed multiple times,

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:06.495
then we can dose mRNA over and over again.

00:11:07.538 --> 00:11:10.165
And that's exactly what's happening.

00:11:10.207 --> 00:11:12.835
So when I went on
clinicaltrials.gov this morning,

00:11:13.502 --> 00:11:20.426
it turns out that there are
over 175 clinical trials now open

00:11:20.467 --> 00:11:23.554
using mRNA-based medicines

00:11:23.595 --> 00:11:25.764
that are recruiting patients.

00:11:25.806 --> 00:11:29.101
Another 54 clinical trials
are waiting in the [wings],

00:11:29.101 --> 00:11:30.519
ready to be opened.